{"module":"path-forward","voice":"male","duration":161.3,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"El camino a seguir","start":0.0,"end":1.43,"words":[[0.0,0.17],[0.17,0.68],[0.68,0.77],[0.77,1.2]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Nada de esta historia era inevitable, y nada es permanente.","start":2.23,"end":6.52,"words":[[2.26,2.55],[2.55,2.69],[2.69,2.98],[2.98,3.49],[3.49,3.71],[3.71,4.51],[4.76,4.83],[4.83,5.12],[5.12,5.27],[5.27,6.07]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Cada uno de estos remedios tiene un historial, y en cada uno hay un papel para ti.","start":6.87,"end":12.85,"words":[[6.9,7.23],[7.23,7.48],[7.48,7.64],[7.64,8.05],[8.05,8.7],[8.7,9.11],[9.11,9.27],[9.27,10.01],[10.3,10.38],[10.38,10.54],[10.54,10.87],[10.87,11.11],[11.11,11.28],[11.28,11.44],[11.44,11.85],[11.85,12.18],[12.18,12.42]]},{"el":"h0","text":"Leyes que hacen costoso el acoso","start":13.2,"end":15.87,"words":[[13.22,13.73],[13.73,13.93],[13.93,14.33],[14.33,15.03],[15.03,15.23],[15.23,15.74]]},{"el":"s0","text":"La Ley CAREN de San Francisco, la ley de Oregón de 2019 y la AB 1775 de California dan un remedio a las personas afectadas.","start":16.57,"end":27.85,"words":[[16.59,16.75],[16.75,16.99],[16.99,17.38],[17.38,17.54],[17.54,17.77],[17.77,18.56],[18.83,18.99],[18.99,19.23],[19.23,19.38],[19.38,19.86],[19.86,20.01],[20.01,21.27],[21.27,21.35],[21.35,21.51],[21.51,21.66],[21.66,23.79],[23.79,23.94],[23.94,24.73],[24.73,24.97],[24.97,25.12],[25.12,25.67],[25.67,25.75],[25.75,25.99],[25.99,26.62],[26.62,27.4]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Una versión federal lo extendería a todo el país.","start":28.2,"end":31.66,"words":[[28.22,28.43],[28.43,28.93],[28.93,29.42],[29.42,29.56],[29.56,30.41],[30.41,30.48],[30.48,30.77],[30.77,30.91],[30.91,31.26]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Lee y mejora el proyecto, y luego pide a tus legisladores que lo presenten.","start":32.01,"end":37.29,"words":[[32.03,32.25],[32.25,32.32],[32.32,32.77],[32.77,32.91],[32.91,33.58],[33.84,33.91],[33.91,34.28],[34.28,34.58],[34.58,34.65],[34.65,34.87],[34.87,35.76],[35.76,35.91],[35.91,36.06],[36.06,36.79]]},{"el":"h1","text":"Otros equipos de respuesta","start":38.19,"end":40.43,"words":[[38.2,38.65],[38.65,39.2],[39.2,39.38],[39.38,40.2]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Programas como CAHOOTS (Eugene) y STAR (Denver) envían paramédicos y consejeros a llamadas que no necesitan policía.","start":41.13,"end":48.32,"words":[[41.14,41.74],[41.74,42.01],[42.01,42.41],[42.41,42.82],[43.05,43.12],[43.12,43.39],[43.39,43.79],[44.02,44.49],[44.49,45.23],[45.23,45.3],[45.3,45.97],[45.97,46.03],[46.03,46.5],[46.5,46.64],[46.64,46.77],[46.77,47.37],[47.37,47.98]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Pregunta a tu concejo municipal si tu ciudad tiene uno.","start":48.67,"end":52.79,"words":[[48.7,49.31],[49.31,49.39],[49.39,49.54],[49.54,50.08],[50.08,50.78],[50.78,50.93],[50.93,51.09],[51.09,51.55],[51.55,51.93],[51.93,52.24]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Decir la verdad en público","start":53.69,"end":55.92,"words":[[53.71,54.13],[54.13,54.3],[54.3,54.82],[54.82,54.99],[54.99,55.58]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Las comisiones de la verdad (Sudáfrica 1996, Greensboro 2004–2006, Canadá 2008–2015) y memoriales como el National Memorial for Peace and Justice de EJI en Montgomery ponen el registro donde todos pueden verlo.","start":56.62,"end":73.54,"words":[[56.62,56.83],[56.83,57.53],[57.53,57.67],[57.67,57.81],[57.81,58.22],[58.22,58.85],[58.85,60.74],[60.99,61.68],[61.68,63.36],[63.61,64.03],[64.03,65.56],[65.81,65.88],[65.88,66.58],[66.58,66.86],[66.86,67.0],[67.0,67.56],[67.56,68.12],[68.12,68.33],[68.33,68.68],[68.68,68.88],[68.88,69.37],[69.37,69.51],[69.51,69.72],[69.72,69.86],[69.86,70.56],[70.56,70.91],[70.91,71.05],[71.05,71.61],[71.61,71.96],[71.96,72.31],[72.31,72.73],[72.73,73.15]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Enseñar estos módulos es parte de ese trabajo.","start":73.89,"end":76.9,"words":[[73.92,74.39],[74.39,74.72],[74.72,75.18],[75.18,75.31],[75.31,75.65],[75.65,75.78],[75.78,75.98],[75.98,76.51]]},{"el":"h3","text":"Reparar","start":77.8,"end":78.81,"words":[[77.85,78.71]]},{"el":"s3","text":"La Ley de Libertades Civiles de 1988 pidió perdón y pagó $20,000 a cada japonés-estadounidense sobreviviente que había sido encarcelado.","start":79.51,"end":91.66,"words":[[79.51,79.66],[79.66,79.88],[79.88,80.03],[80.03,80.78],[80.78,81.3],[81.3,81.45],[81.45,83.46],[83.46,83.84],[83.84,84.28],[84.28,84.36],[84.36,84.66],[84.66,86.67],[86.67,86.74],[86.74,87.04],[87.04,88.61],[88.61,89.58],[89.58,89.73],[89.73,90.1],[90.1,90.4],[90.4,91.29]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Carolina del Norte y Virginia han compensado a sobrevivientes de esterilizaciones.","start":92.01,"end":97.83,"words":[[92.05,92.64],[92.64,92.86],[92.86,93.23],[93.23,93.31],[93.31,93.9],[93.9,94.05],[94.05,94.79],[94.79,94.86],[94.86,95.9],[95.9,96.05],[96.05,97.31]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Evanston, Illinois, comenzó reparaciones de vivienda en 2021, el Grupo de Trabajo sobre Reparaciones de California publicó su informe final en 2023 y el proyecto H.R.","start":98.18,"end":111.63,"words":[[98.2,98.85],[99.09,99.74],[99.99,100.49],[100.49,101.34],[101.34,101.48],[101.48,102.06],[102.06,102.2],[102.2,103.41],[103.66,103.8],[103.8,104.16],[104.16,104.3],[104.3,104.8],[104.8,105.16],[105.16,106.01],[106.01,106.16],[106.16,106.87],[106.87,107.37],[107.37,107.51],[107.51,108.01],[108.01,108.37],[108.37,108.51],[108.51,109.65],[109.65,109.72],[109.72,109.87],[109.87,110.44],[110.44,111.01]]},{"el":"s3","text":"40 crearía una comisión federal.","start":111.98,"end":114.72,"words":[[112.01,112.55],[112.55,113.09],[113.09,113.3],[113.3,113.84],[113.84,114.38]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Si hacer más, y cómo, se debate; los precedentes están documentados.","start":115.07,"end":121.01,"words":[[115.1,115.26],[115.26,115.57],[115.57,115.89],[116.17,116.25],[116.25,116.65],[116.92,117.08],[117.08,117.64],[117.92,118.15],[118.15,119.03],[119.03,119.43],[119.43,120.46]]},{"el":"h4","text":"Limpiar los códigos","start":121.91,"end":123.64,"words":[[121.93,122.59],[122.59,122.87],[122.87,123.52]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Todavía hay lenguaje de la era de la segregación en algunos códigos y escrituras.","start":124.34,"end":129.68,"words":[[124.35,124.93],[124.93,125.08],[125.08,125.66],[125.66,125.81],[125.81,125.95],[125.95,126.17],[126.17,126.32],[126.32,126.46],[126.46,127.27],[127.27,127.41],[127.41,127.92],[127.92,128.43],[128.43,128.5],[128.5,129.31]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Los voluntarios pueden verificar leyes antiguas y entregar solicitudes de derogación, y muchos estados ya permiten a los dueños eliminar las cláusulas de sus escrituras.","start":130.03,"end":141.1,"words":[[130.07,130.29],[130.29,131.07],[131.07,131.5],[131.5,132.14],[132.14,132.5],[132.5,133.07],[133.07,133.14],[133.14,133.71],[133.71,134.49],[134.49,134.64],[134.64,135.42],[135.67,135.74],[135.74,136.17],[136.17,136.67],[136.67,136.81],[136.81,137.38],[137.38,137.45],[137.45,137.67],[137.67,138.09],[138.09,138.66],[138.66,138.88],[138.88,139.52],[139.52,139.66],[139.66,139.88],[139.88,140.66]]},{"el":"h5","text":"Presencia local","start":142.0,"end":143.24,"words":[[142.0,142.77],[142.77,143.2]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Los fiscales de distrito, alguaciles y concejos municipales deciden cómo se usa a la policía, y a menudo se eligen por unos pocos miles de votos.","start":143.94,"end":155.0,"words":[[143.98,144.22],[144.22,144.88],[144.88,145.04],[145.04,145.78],[146.07,146.89],[146.89,146.97],[146.97,147.63],[147.63,148.53],[148.53,149.1],[149.1,149.43],[149.43,149.6],[149.6,149.84],[149.84,149.92],[149.92,150.09],[150.09,150.83],[151.11,151.19],[151.19,151.28],[151.28,151.77],[151.77,151.93],[151.93,152.42],[152.42,152.67],[152.67,153.0],[153.0,153.41],[153.41,153.82],[153.82,153.98],[153.98,154.47]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Regístrate, verifica tu registro y vota en las elecciones locales.","start":155.35,"end":160.43,"words":[[155.36,156.18],[156.44,157.03],[157.03,157.18],[157.18,157.77],[157.77,157.85],[157.85,158.15],[158.15,158.29],[158.29,158.52],[158.52,159.26],[159.26,159.85]]}]}